# @vit/ui — manifest/workspace patch for the integrator

Track 1 delivered `packages/ui/` (committed). The workspace glob already
covers it, so no root `package.json` edit is required. The only remaining
integrator step is registering the new workspace in `bun.lock`.

## Required action (integrator)

```sh
bun install
```

This registers `packages/ui` as the `@vit/ui` workspace in `bun.lock`,
creates the `node_modules/@vit/ui` symlink, and installs nothing new — every
dependency is already in the lockfile at these exact versions:

| package | version | reason |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `solid-js` | ^1.8.0 (peer; repo runs 1.9.14) | peer |
| `@kobalte/core` | ^0.13.11 (peer; repo runs 0.13.11) | peer |
| `@solar-icons/solid` | 2.0.0-beta.3 | already patched in root `patchedDependencies` |
| `class-variance-authority` | ^0.7.1 | storefront dep |
| `clsx` | ^2.1.1 | storefront dep |
| `tailwind-merge` | ^3 | storefront dep |
| `tsdown` | catalog: | dev |
| `typescript` | ^5 (peer) | peer |

No existing package.json is touched. `bun.lock` changes are expected and are
the only lockfile diff from this track.

