## Exports contract (what Track 2 imports)

- `import { Button, Field, Input, Select, ... } from "@vit/ui"`
- `import "@vit/ui/styles.css"` — app global CSS entry
- Tokens become Tailwind utilities (`bg-butter`, `text-ink`, `border-rule`,
  `rounded-ui`, `shadow-card`, `shadow-pop`, `shadow-lift`, `outline-ring`)
  and raw CSS vars (`--ui-*`).

## Consumer setup Track 2 must add (in its global CSS)

```css
@import "@vit/ui/styles.css";
@source "../../../packages/ui/src";   /* so Tailwind scans package classes */
```

`@source` paths are relative to the app's CSS file. Without it, utility
classes inside the package are not generated.

